# Privacy Policy

**Effective Date:** 24 March, 2026
**App Name:** Tappy Plane
**Developer:** ShinoJull Games

## 1. Introduction

ShinoJull Games ("we", "our", "us") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use our mobile application.

## 2. Information We Collect

### a) Account Information

If you choose to sign in with your email address, we collect and store:

- Your email address
- A unique account identifier (used internally to link your saved progress, purchases, and leaderboard entries to your account)

This is used to sync your progress across devices, save your high scores, and let you appear on leaderboards. Signing in is optional — you can continue to play without an account, though your progress will only be saved locally on that device.

### b) Gameplay & Crash Data

- **Saved progress:** high scores, coins, gems, and unlocked cosmetics, tied to your account or device.
- **Leaderboard entries:** your chosen display name and score, shown publicly to other players.
- **Crash reports:** if you opt in via the in-app consent prompt, we use Firebase Crashlytics to collect crash logs (device state and app logs at the time of a crash) to help us diagnose and fix bugs. This is off by default and only enabled if you allow it in Settings — you can turn it off at any time.

### c) Advertising Data (AdMob)

We use Google AdMob to display ads in our app. AdMob may collect and process the following data:

- Device identifiers (such as Advertising ID)
- IP address
- App usage data
- Interaction with ads

This data is used to provide and improve advertising services.

### d) Device Information

We may collect limited device-related information, including:

- Device model
- Operating system version
- Language settings
- App version

This information helps us improve app performance and compatibility.

### e) Cookies and Identifiers

Our app and advertising partners may use:

- Cookies (where applicable)
- Mobile advertising identifiers
- Similar tracking technologies

These are used to:

- Deliver relevant ads
- Measure ad performance
- Prevent fraud

## 3. How We Use Information

We use collected data to:

- Create and manage your account, and sync your progress across devices
- Show your scores and display name on leaderboards
- Show ads through AdMob
- Improve gameplay experience
- Fix bugs and crashes (via optional crash reporting)
- Analyze app performance
- Process in-app purchases through Google Play Billing

## 4. Third-Party Services

We use third-party services that may collect information:

- Google Firebase (Authentication, database, Crashlytics crash reporting)
- Google Play Billing (in-app purchases)
- Google AdMob (Advertising)

You can review their policies here: [https://policies.google.com/privacy](https://policies.google.com/privacy)

## 5. Data Sharing

We do not sell your personal data.

However, data may be shared with:

- Google Firebase, as our backend service provider (account, save data, crash reports)
- Google Play, for purchases and billing
- Advertising partners (AdMob)
- Service providers for analytics and performance

## 6. User Rights

Depending on your location, you may have rights to:

- Access your data
- Request deletion
- Opt-out of personalized ads

You can manage ad preferences here: [https://adssettings.google.com](https://adssettings.google.com)

To request deletion of your Tappy Plane account and data, visit our [Delete My Account](delete-account.html) page.

## 7. Children's Privacy

Our app is not directed to children under 13 (or equivalent age in your region).

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

## 8. Security

We take reasonable measures to protect your data, but no method is 100% secure.

## 9. Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected on this page.

